   "Commercial Exploitation" means deriving revenue from the Software or a Derivative as such. It includes, without limitation:

     (a) selling, licensing, renting or sublicensing the Software or a Derivative;
     (b) charging any fee for access to it, or making access conditional on a paid subscription or plan;
